\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Vedarganj police station OC Mintu Mandal said, ' Around 10 pm on Sunday, a young man named Sanjay Rakshit was arrested for writing two lines in the Facebook story. Some local people claimed that the writing hurt the sentiments of Muslims. They made a verbal complaint of blasphemy on the matter. So to avoid social chaos, Sanjay was arrested and sent to Shariatpur District Jail'.}
